      "id": 13247,
      "name": "Natediggadoggity",
      "username": "Natediggadoggity",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/f04885/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-07-06T06:04:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Since there are 6 variants in infernal relics, I think it would be a better idea to have 6 separate threads; One per variant. That way we can work on more than one at a time, without getting one thread crowded with 6 separate conversations.</p><p>If it's deemed a better idea to have only 1 thread, then we should invoke a rule where the poster has to put a header at the top of the post, talking about which unlock they are working on. Other thoughts, votes on this issue?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:59.552Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
